  "referenceNumber": "INU0292",
  "remarks": "\nMorteza REZAIE is an involved person within the meaning of the Iran (Sanctions) (Nuclear) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019. Morteza REZAIE is a member of or associated with the Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC), which is or has been involved in a relevant nuclear activity, namely the development of a nuclear weapon delivery system in, or for use in, Iran.",
